{"id":"en_the-heiress-they-wrongly-disowned","title":"The Heiress They Wrongly Disowned","titleEn":"The Heiress They Wrongly Disowned","description":"For a quarter of a century, Avery was regarded by the Cole family as nothing more than a fraudulent stand-in for their genuine daughter. Once that daughter came back, they expelled her without hesitation. What they never suspected was that Avery had quietly amassed an empire of money and influence all her own. When the Coles attempted to seize what she had built, they discovered she had never depended on them in the first place. Now prepared to sever every remaining tie, Avery finds her plans complicated by the arrival of a man of considerable power.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-heiress-they-wrongly-disowned/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-heiress-they-wrongly-disowned/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Business","Female Growth","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dh22w/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-heiress-they-wrongly-disowned_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dh22w/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-heiress-they-wrongly-disowned_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dh22w/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-heiress-they-wrongly-disowned_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dh22w/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-heiress-they-wrongly-disowned_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":